    "Generating tournament banners and rider avatars uses OpenAI's image API with your own key, stored only in this device's Keychain. Without a key, you can still add photos from your library. Get a key at platform.openai.com/api-keys." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Generating tournament banners and rider avatars uses OpenAI's image API with your own key, stored only in this device's Keychain. Without a key, you can still add photos from your library. Get a key at platform.openai.com/api-keys."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
